"stats":[41,23,66,67,58,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1015505","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1055","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[41,23,66,67,58,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1015505","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1055","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[41,23,66,67,58,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1015505","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[41,23,66,67,58,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1015505","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10957","city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[41,23,66,67,58,54],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1015505","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东汉大臣，丁仪、丁廙之父，徐州沛国人。与曹操关系亲善。任黄门侍郎，与侍中杨琦、大将杨奉、黄门侍郎钟繇、尚书左丞鲁充、尚书郎韩斌及李傕部将杨帛、宋果共谋诛杀李傕，事泄杨帛被杀后，仍助力汉献帝东归。建安元年，致信曹操劝其奉迎天子，后随献帝迁都许县，封列侯，任司隶校尉，数年后因饮酒过度烂肠而死，曹操常感念其功。","tc":"東漢大臣，丁儀、丁廙之父，徐州沛國人。與曹操關系親善。任黃門侍郎，與侍中楊琦、大將楊奉、黃門侍郎鐘繇、尚書左丞魯充、尚書郎韓斌及李傕部將楊帛、宋果共謀誅殺李傕，事泄楊帛被殺后，仍助力漢獻帝東歸。建安元年，致信曹操勸其奉迎天子，后隨獻帝遷都許縣，封列侯，任司隸校尉，數年后因飲酒過度爛腸而死，曹操常感念其功。","en":"A minister of the Later Han and father of Ding Yi and Ding Yi, hailing from Pei State in Xu Province. He maintained friendly relations with Cao Cao. Serving as Attendant, he conspired with Commandant Yang Qi, General Yang Feng, Attendant Zhong Yao, Left Assistant Imperial Secretary Lu Chong, Secretarial Cadet Han Bin, and Li Jue's subordinate generals Yang Bo and Song Guo to slay Li Jue. Even after the plot was leaked and Yang Bo was executed, he still assisted Emperor Xian of Han in his journey east. In the first year of Jianan, he wrote to Cao Cao urging him to welcome the Emperor. He later accompanied Emperor Xian when the capital moved to Xu County, was enfeoffed as a Marquis, and served as Colonel of Sili. Several years later, he died of ruptured intestines from excessive drinking, Cao Cao often remembered his deeds with gratitude.","jp":"後漢の重臣で、丁儀・丁廙の父。徐州沛国の人。曹操とは親善の関係にあった。黄門侍郎を務め、侍中の楊琦、大将の楊奉、黄門侍郎の鍾繇、尚書左丞の魯充、尚書郎の韓斌、李傕の部将の楊帛や宋果らと李傕の暗殺を謀るも、露見して楊帛が殺された後は、漢の献帝の東帰を助けた。建安元年、曹操に書簡を送って天子を迎えるよう勧め、献帝に従って許県へ遷都した後は列侯に封じられ、司隷校尉を務めた。数年後に過度の飲酒で腸が爛れて病死したが、曹操は常にその功績を偲んでいた。","kr":"동한의 대신이자 정의, 정이의 부친으로 서주 패국 사람이다. 조조와 친선 관계였다. 황문시랑을 지내며 시중 양기, 대장 양봉, 황문시랑 종요, 상서좌승 노충, 상서랑 한빈 및 이각의 부장 양백, 송과와 함께 이각을 주살하기로 공모했다. 일이 누설되어 양백이 살해된 후에도 한 헌제의 동귀를 도왔다. 건안 원년에 조조에게 서신을 보내 천자를 받들어 맞이할 것을 권했고, 이후 헌제를 따라 허현으로 천도하여 열후에 봉해지고 사례교위를 지냈다. 몇 년 뒤 술을 과하게 마셔 창자가 썩어 죽었으나, 조조는 늘 그의 공을 기렸다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1013815","remark":"","surname":"丁","surnameTc":"丁","surnameEn":"Ding","surnameJp":"丁","surnameKr":"정","surnameOther":"","name":"冲","nameTc":"沖","nameEn":"Chong","nameJp":"沖","nameKr":"충","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"丁冲","power":"WJ10001","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1025","gender":"0","rule":"41","force":"23","wise":"66","politics":